            <div xml:id="d149">

                <pb facs="0381" n="67" sameAs="frus:frus1914Supp/pg67"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72/522</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Italy</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Page</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <dateline>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Embassy</hi>, <lb/>
                    <placeName>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Rome</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                        when="1914-08-19T15:00:00+01:00">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">August 19, 1914, 3 p.m.</hi>
                    </date>
                    <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received 4 p.m.</hi>] </dateline>
                <p rendition="#center">[Telegram]</p>
                <p>Italy seems quietly but earnestly preparing for eventualities. Strong general
                    feeling apparent favoring her taking sides against Austria.</p>
                <closer>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Embassy</hi>
                </closer>
            </div>
